  "notes": [
    "Briarwake has a new Suno nighttime ambience track, mastered into a restrained seamless loop that leaves room for hunter and navigation sounds.",
    "Garden footsteps now follow grass, dirt and shed wood for the local survivor, multiplayer survivors and the Thornkeeper. Other players have directional proximity footsteps; hunter detection rules are unchanged.",
    "Briarwake mist is darker, thinner and neutral in color, with dim nighttime lighting and a matching low-graphics fallback. The improved hedge geometry is preserved.",
    "Blackwater keeps its existing ambience and distinct Repeater and Reaver footstep recordings.",
    "Close the game, choose Check for updates, then Update & restart. Update everyone to 0.23.21 before testing together. Existing settings are preserved."
  ],
